## 🏗️ World Building & Map Design
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @builder_alex
**Deadline:** 2026-09-15
**Type:** Design
**Image:** https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop
**Link:** https://roblox.com
Pengembangan aset 3D lingkungan, lighting atmospherik neon, dan arsitektur kota Cyberpunk di Studio Roblox.

### 🌃 Central Cyber Hub & Neon Plaza
**Status:** Done
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @builder_alex
**Deadline:** 2026-08-10
**Type:** 3D Modeling
**Image:** https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop
**Link:** https://checker.spawnera.com
Desain plaza utama pusat kota dengan billboard neon dinamis, jalanan asphalt hujan reflektif, dan toko-toko interaktif.

### 🍃 River Hangout & Nature Sanctuary
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @terrain_master
**Deadline:** 2026-08-30
**Type:** Terrain
**Image:** https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop
Area sungai alami menggunakan Roblox Smooth Terrain, sistem air jernih dengan shader refleksi, gazebo santai, dan lokasi pemancingan.

### 🏛️ Player Housing & Tycoon Plots
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @builder_alex
**Deadline:** 2026-09-10
**Type:** Building
Sistem kavling tanah fleksibel yang dapat dibeli pemain untuk membangun penthouse cyberpunk 3 lantai secara bertahap.

## ⚡ Luau Core Engine & Game Mechanics
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @scripter_dev
**Deadline:** 2026-09-30
**Type:** Scripting
**Image:** https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop
**Link:** https://create.roblox.com/docs
Arsitektur backend Luau menggunakan Knit Framework, DataStore v2, dan sistem sinkronisasi Server-Client.

### 💾 Profile DataStore v2 Engine
**Status:** Done
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @backend_ken
**Deadline:** 2026-08-12
**Type:** Backend
Sistem penyimpanan data inventaris, koin, level, dan statistik pemain yang aman dari duplikasi (Anti-Duping) menggunakan ProfileService.

### ⚔️ Cyber Combat & Ability System
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @scripter_dev
**Deadline:** 2026-09-05
**Type:** Gameplay
Sistem pertarungan jarak dekat & senjata energi (raycasting hitboxes, stamina bar, skill cooldowns, dan animation blending).

### 🐶 Pet Companion & Gacha System
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @scripter_dev
**Deadline:** 2026-09-20
**Type:** Feature
Sistem hatch telur pet gacha 3D, pet pathfinding mengikuti avatar pemain, serta sistem secure trading antar pemain.

### 🛡️ Exploiter Protection & Anti-Cheat
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @backend_ken
**Deadline:** 2026-09-25
**Type:** Security
Sanitasi remote event server-side, pemantauan batas kecepatan (Speedhack check), noclip detection, dan auto-ban system.

## 🎨 UI/UX & Interactive Interfaces
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @ui_designer
**Deadline:** 2026-09-12
**Type:** UI/UX
**Image:** https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop
Desain antarmuka pengguna modern yang responsif untuk Mobile, PC, dan Console (Xbox/PlayStation).

### 📊 Futuristic HUD & Mini-map GPS
**Status:** Done
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @ui_designer
**Deadline:** 2026-08-16
**Type:** UI
Bar kesehatan neon, indikator level, mini-map GPS interaktif, dan notifikasi pencapaian (achievement popups).

### 🛒 In-Game Shop & Gamepass Store
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @ui_designer
**Deadline:** 2026-09-01
**Type:** Economy
Modal toko Roblox Developer Products, pembelian Gamepass VIP, booster koin 2x, dan pratinjau barang 3D (ViewportFrame).

## 🎵 Soundscapes & Visual Effects (VFX)
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🔵 Low
**Pic:** @vfx_artist
**Deadline:** 2026-09-18
**Type:** Audio/VFX
Pengolahan efek audio spasial 3D, musik latar synthwave, dan partikel neon yang memukau.

### ✨ Cyber Particle Emitters & Skill VFX
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @vfx_artist
**Deadline:** 2026-09-15
**Type:** VFX
Efek kilatan pedang laser, ledakan plasma energi, aura kombo pet, dan trail jejak kaki bercahaya.

### 🔊 Spatial 3D Audio & Soundtracks
**Status:** In Progress
**Priority:** 🔵 Low
**Pic:** @sound_designer
**Deadline:** 2026-09-08
**Type:** Audio
Musik latar ambient synthwave yang menyesuaikan lokasi pemain (Kota vs Sungai Hangout) dan efek suara langkah kaki di berbagai material.

## 🧪 QA, Optimization & Launch Strategy
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @qa_lead
**Deadline:** 2026-10-05
**Type:** QA/Launch

### 📱 Low-End Mobile & StreamingEnabled Audit
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🔴 High
**Pic:** @qa_lead
**Deadline:** 2026-09-28
**Type:** Optimization
Optimasi Draw Calls, pembersihan memory leak pada event listener, serta pengujian StreamingEnabled untuk pemuatan peta instan.

### 📢 Roblox Ad Campaign & Influencer Event
**Status:** Todo
**Priority:** 🟡 Medium
**Pic:** @marketing_manager
**Deadline:** 2026-10-01
**Type:** Marketing
Peluncuran sponsor ad banner Roblox, pembuatan badge eksklusif peluncuran (First 10K Players Badge), dan kolaborasi streamer Roblox.
