nt Boards, Metadata Tables, and Calendar Schedules instantly 100% local in your browser.`,privacyStatTitle:`100% Local Privacy`,privacyStatDesc:`Data stays in your browser without uploading to cloud.`,viewsStatTitle:`5 Perspectives`,viewsStatDesc:`Mindmap, Kanban, Table, Calendar, & Summary.`,presetStatTitle:`Multi-Preset`,presetStatDesc:`Ready for Software, Game Dev, & Notes.`,syncStatTitle:`Disk Sync`,syncStatDesc:`Synced two-way with your local .md files.`,dropActive:`Drop Markdown File to Open Project`,dropInactive:`Drag & Drop Your Markdown File Here`,dropSub:`Supports .md or .markdown files. Your file will be converted into a visual workspace.`,btnOpenLocal:`Choose Local Markdown File`,btnDemoRoblox:`Roblox Project Sample`,btnDemoTech:`SaaS Project Sample`},howItWorks:{sectionTag:`Simple Workflow`,title:`How MDFlow Works in 3 Easy Steps`,subtitle:`No database setup required. Just use your local Markdown files.`,step1Title:`Open or Drag Markdown File`,step1Desc:`Import .md files from your computer. No account sign-up, processed locally in browser.`,step2Title:`Choose Visual Workspace Mode`,step2Desc:`Switch instantly between Mindmap, Kanban Board, Metadata Table, Calendar, or Summary.`,step3Title:`Edit Visually & Auto-Sync`,step3Desc:`Change status or details visually. Changes save directly back to your Markdown file.`},features:{sectionTag:`Core Visual Features`,title:`One Markdown File, Six Visual Perspectives`,subtitle:`Every team member can pick their favorite view according to their specific project needs.`,summaryLabel:`Summary Analytics`,summaryDesc:`Visual metrics, completion charts, deadline alerts, & project statistics.`,mindmapLabel:`Mindmap Hierarchy`,mindmapDesc:`Interactive visualization of ideation tree & task connections.`,kanbanLabel:`Kanban Sprint Board`,kanbanDesc:`Drag & drop tasks across status columns (Todo, Progress, Done, Review) fluidly.`,tableLabel:`Dynamic Metadata Table`,tableDesc:`Sort, filter, and manage custom columns like PIC, Pr