etadata dalam format berikut di baris tepat setelah heading:

**Status:** Todo | Progress | Done
**Priority:** High | Medium | Low
**Pic:** @username
**Deadline:** YYYY-MM-DD

Tolong hasilkan rencana proyek yang mematuhi format Markdown MDFlow ini.`,en:`I am using MDFlow for my project management. MDFlow is a visual workspace that parses standard Markdown into mindmaps, kanban boards, and tables. When generating project structures, features, or tasks, use headings for hierarchy (H1, H2, H3). For each task/feature heading, include metadata exactly in this format on the lines immediately following the heading:

**Status:** Todo | Progress | Done
**Priority:** High | Medium | Low
**Pic:** @username
**Deadline:** YYYY-MM-DD

