ide1Desc:`MDFlow uses standard Markdown files (.md) as the primary data source. No separate database — all structure, status, and metadata are read from and saved directly back to your file.`,guide2Title:`2. How Metadata Works`,guide2Desc:"Use metadata inline below feature headings, such as `status: 🟢 Done`, `priority: 🔴 High`, `pic: @Username`, `deadline: 2026-12-31`.",guide3Title:`3. Drag & Drop in Kanban & Mindmap`,guide3Desc:`Drag feature cards across columns (e.g. from Todo to Progress). Card status in your Markdown file will be updated immediately!`},settings:{title:`Visual Workspace Settings`,subtitle:`Configure display preferences, color themes, custom status management, and autosave behavior.`,themeTab:`Theme & Display`,columnTab:`Column Visibility`,statusTab:`Manage Kanban Statuses`,fileTab:`File & Auto-Save`,themeTitle:`Select Interface Theme`,themeDesc:`Choose the color scheme that is most comfortable for viewing Mindmap diagrams and feature tables.`,darkLabel:`Dark Mode`,darkDesc:`Deep high contrast`,midnightLabel:`Midnight Blue`,midnightDesc:`Navy blue vibes`,lightLabel:`Light Mode`,lightDesc:`Clean & bright`,colTitle:`Select Displayed Columns`,colDesc:`Configure which metadata fields to display in Table, Mindmap, Kanban, and Tree views.`,tableColTitle:`Columns in Table View`,kanbanColTitle:`Kanban Card Info`,mindmapColTitle:`Mindmap Node Badges`,showDescPreview:`Description Preview`,showPriorityBadge:`Priority Badge`,showTypeBadge:`Type Badge`,showPicBadge:`PIC Badge`,showDeadlineBadge:`Deadline Badge`,showSubCount:`Sub-feature Count`,showStatusBadge:`Show Status`,showImageBadge:`Image`,showLinkBadge:`Link`,statusTitle:`Kanban Column Status List`,statusDesc:`Add or delete feature statuses. These statuses will be columns on the Kanban board and options in the detail panel.`,newStatusTitle:`Add New Status`,newStatusPlaceholder:`E.g.: 🔵 In Review or 🟣 Blocked`,addStatusBtn:`Add`,fileTitle:`File & Auto-Save Settings`,fileDesc:`Control how changes are save